=Client: {{ $('Parse Requirements').first().json.clientName }}

[PART 2 of 2] Generate props, events, data_layer_map, and brd_traceability.
Steps: (1) call get_evars_data to get the compact eVar list from Part 1, (2) call get_requirements_data for the BRD, (3) call get_sdr_guide for allocation rules, (4) produce output JSON.

